                        <shortname>CreateProductionRecord</shortname>
                        <description>Creates a Production History Record based on the details of the transaction that is triggered. The command takes all the details of the triggered transaction as input. It checks the value set for Configuration Key: EnableEventBasedTracing. If it is set to True, the TraceProductionRecord event is fired. If it is set to False, the AddProductionTraces internal command is called.</description>
