                        <shortname>MigrateApplicationLogMessageToProductionHistoryRecord</shortname>
                        <description>Migrates Application Log Messages to Production History Records. During migration, the command deletes or retains the Application Log messages depending on the input property configuration. The command takes the following input: - A True / False value for the DeleteMigratedApplicationLogMessages input property. A True value indicates deleting of messages as Apllication Logs after migration to Production History. A False value indicates messages are retained as Application Logs also along with Production History. - A List of messages to be migrated. The MessageIdOwnerList property takes the input in the form of a combination of message Id and Owner.</description>
